<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head> 
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#171218">
  <title>Studio Sensuelle — Révélez votre mouvement</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Une école digitale de danse sensuelle, de mouvement et d'expression corporelle.">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #171218;
      color: #f4eee9;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px 7%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #453744;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 19px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      color: #e6d4c8;
    }

    .menu {
      color: #c9a8c5;
      font: 12px Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 78vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 70px 9%;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(23,18,24,.97), rgba(23,18,24,.65)),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 50%, #68445f, #171218 65%);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: #d5a9c8;
      font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(43px, 9vw, 82px);
      font-weight: normal;
      line-height: 1.08;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    h1 em { color: #d5a9c8; }

    .intro {
      font: 15px/1.8 Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #d0c4cd;
      max-width: 460px;
      margin: 27px 0 35px;
    }

    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 16px 25px;
      background: #d5a9c8;
      color: #211722;
      text-decoration: none;
      font: 12px Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    section.disciplines {
      padding: 75px 8%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .section-text {
      font: 14px/1.7 Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #bfb0bd;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .courses {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .course {
      border: 1px solid #554354;
      padding: 35px 15px;
      color: #e7d8e3;
      font-size: 23px;
      background: #211a24;
    }

    .course small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: #bba9b9;
      font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 8%;
      border-top: 1px solid #453744;
      color: #a99aa8;
      text-align: center;
      font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">STUDIO SENSUELLE</div>
    <div class="menu">L'ÉCOLE DU MOUVEMENT</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">DANSE · EXPRESSION · CONFIANCE</p>

      <h1>Habitez votre corps.<br>
      Révélez votre <em>mouvement.</em></h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Un espace pour explorer votre sensualité,
        développer votre expression corporelle et
        découvrir le plaisir de danser librement.
      </p>

      <a class="cta" href="#disciplines">Découvrir l'école</a>
    </div>

    <section class="disciplines" id="disciplines">
      <p class="eyebrow">EXPLOREZ VOTRE UNIVERS</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Votre mouvement, vos règles.</h2>
      <p class="section-text">
        Des disciplines complémentaires pour apprendre,
        progresser et prendre plaisir à bouger.
      </p>

      <div class="courses">
        <div class="course">Heels<small>TECHNIQUE & ATTITUDE</small></div>
        <div class="course">Sensual Dance<small>FLUIDITÉ & EXPRESSION</small></div>
        <div class="course">Chair Dance<small>FORCE & CRÉATIVITÉ</small></div>
        <div class="course">Floorwork<small>MOUVEMENT AU SOL</small></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    STUDIO SENSUELLE · LE CORPS EN MOUVEMENT
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
